# A login flow with a retry loop.
participant C as Client
participant A as API
participant D as Database

C -> A: POST /login
A -> D: SELECT user
D --> A: row
alt password ok
  A --> C: 200 token
else password bad
  A --> C: 401
  C -> A: POST /login (retry)
  A --> C: 200 token
end
note over C,A: token cached for 15 minutes
